<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; color: #1d1d1e; margin: 1em 0 10px;">Dear Colleague,<br><br>The City of Columbus Office of Diversity and Inclusion invites you to join us for our upcoming Big Table — a chance to connect, share ideas, and be part of the conversation. Since 2016, the <a href="https://columbusfoundation.org/the-big-table?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #00549b;">Columbus Foundation</a> has brought Central Ohioans together for an annual community-wide day of conversation designed to inspire civic engagement and connection.</p>
<div>
<div>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; color: #1d1d1e; margin: 0 0 10px;">Come be a part of an engaging and insightful discussion on key Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion (DEI) issues facing our community. This invite-only event will provide a platform for thought leaders, stakeholders, and community members to share ideas, explore solutions, and foster a more inclusive Columbus. We’ll dive into the local impacts of DEI initiatives, tariffs, executive orders and so much more!<br><br><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline; line-height: 1.4;">Event Details:<br></span></strong>Date: Tuesday, October 21, 2025<br>Time: 6:00 pm to 7:30 pm<br>Location: Brick Studio (East Market)<br>1640 Oak Street<br>Columbus, OH 43205<br><strong>RSVP Deadline: Friday, October 17th, 2025</strong></p>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; color: #1d1d1e; margin: 0 0 10px;"><span style="text-decoration: underline; line-height: 1.4;"><strong>Additional Information:</strong></span> <br>Pre-registration is required<br>Dinner will be provided<br>Free parking onsite and on adjacent streets<br><br></p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; color: #1d1d1e; margin: 0 0 10px;">We look forward to hearing your ideas and perspectives. Together, we can continue building a more equitable and inclusive Columbus.</p>
</div>
<div>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; color: #1d1d1e; margin: 0 0 10px;">Warm regards,</p>
</div>
<img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2025/10/12481180/6478955/jj-signature_crop.png" style="width: 540px; height: auto; -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; line-height: 1; outline: none; text-decoration: none; max-width: 100%; border: none;" alt="jj" width="540" height="98"><p class="cvGsUA direction-ltr align-start para-style-body" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; color: #1d1d1e; margin: 1em 0 10px;"><span class="a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none" style="line-height: 1.4;">Jason T. Jenkins</span></p>
